    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The sacred promise of a medical entrance exam was shattered when a devoted truth-teller exposed a profound betrayal of trust. From the Indian city of Sikar, an informant sent a passionate confession revealing leaked exam materials that perfectly matched the chemistry paper. This disclosure forced a testing agency to refer the matter to an investigation agency, leading to the arrest of thirteen people and a scheduled re-examination on June 21 as a chance to rebuild trust on a new foundation.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Lover",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "What began as a scheduled examination became a stage for a predetermined violation of trust. The old, tainted bond of the NEET-UG 2026 was dissolved after a tipster revealed stolen secrets, prompting a law enforcement action. Those who violated trust now face the consequences, with thirteen arrested individuals held accountable, while the national investigative agency pursues justice for the betrayed students who will take a rescheduled test date.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Lover",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
