      ],
      "fit": 0.68
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A guardian of academic integrity in the country of India sought to restore trust after a bitter revelation. The disclosure from a whistleblower exposed intimate insiders whose trust was violated, leading to an arrest of suspects. This painful reminder of a broken pact will linger over the new examination date set for June 21, as the bureaucratic entity that failed to prevent the initial breach now works with a national investigative agency to bring closure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Lover",
